{"source":"user","type":"text","message":"text-rest\nゴルフを3Dで解析するアプリを作って。そのアプリにスイング動画をuploadするだけで, 動画中に三次元の力の向きをクラブと人間の手の接点, つまりグリップに表示して, 使用者は自身のゴルフ動画からスイングをどう改善すべきか自習できるものにして"}
{"source":"assistant","type":"text","message":"ゴルフスイングを3D解析して、グリップ（手とクラブの接点）に力のベクトルを重ねて表示する自習用アプリを作りますね。\n\nまず設計方針を正直に共有します。**1台のカメラで撮った動画からは「本物のニュートン力」は直接測れません**（力覚センサーが要る）。そこで、ブラウザ内でAIがグリップの3D位置を毎フレーム追跡し、その運動（加速度 F≈m·a）から**合力の向きと大きさを推定**して矢印で重ねる、という物理的に筋の通った近似で作ります。これは実際に動く実用アプリになります。\n\n技術構成：\n- **MediaPipe**（Google）で手＋全身の3Dランドマークをブラウザ内推定（サーバー送信なし＝プライバシー安全）\n- グリップ = 両手の接点を毎フレーム追跡 → 平滑化 → 速度・加速度・**3D合力ベクトル**を計算\n- 動画上に力の矢印を重畳表示＋**Three.jsの3Dビュー**で立体的に確認\n- スイングプレーン角・テンポ比・ピーク合力タイミングを自動採点し、**日本語で改善アドバイス**\n\n作っていきます。"}
{"source":"tool","type":"tool_call","toolUseId":"toolu_015wUWfPKUCrGUgFbeZbMmLJ","toolName":"Write","args":{"file_path":"/Users/ueharahisashi/mulmoclaude/artifacts/html/2026/07/golf-3d-swing.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ja\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<title>Golf 3D Swing Lab — スイング力ベクトル解析</title>\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --bg:#0b1220; --panel:#111a2e; --panel2:#16233f; --line:#22304f;\n    --txt:#e8eefc; --muted:#93a4c6; --accent:#3fb6ff; --accent2:#7c5cff;\n    --good:#37d69a; --warn:#ffcf5c; --bad:#ff6b6b; --force:#ff4d5e;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--txt);\n    font-family:-apple-system,\"Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN\",\"Noto Sans JP\",system-ui,sans-serif;}\n  a{color:var(--accent)}\n  .wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:18px 16px 60px}\n  header.top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  header.top h1{font-size:20px;margin:0;letter-spacing:.3px}\n  .badge{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--line);\n    padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px}\n  .sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin:2px 0 16px;line-height:1.6}\n  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:16px}\n  @media(max-width:980px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n  .card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;\n    padding:14px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}\n  .card h2{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;\n    letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:700}\n  .stagewrap{position:relative;width:100%;background:#000;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;\n    aspect-ratio:16/9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  video#vid{display:none}\n  canvas#overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}\n  .drop{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;gap:12px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;padding:20px;\n    border:2px dashed var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:rgba(20,30,55,.6);cursor:pointer;transition:.2s}\n  .drop.drag{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--txt);background:rgba(63,182,255,.08)}\n  .drop b{color:var(--txt);font-size:15px}\n  .drop small{font-size:12px;max-width:360px;line-height:1.6}\n  .btn{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent),#2b93e0);color:#04121f;border:none;\n    padding:9px 16px;border-radius:9px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px}\n  .btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}\n  .btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--txt);border:1px solid var(--line)}\n  .btn.sm{padding:6px 11px;font-size:12px}\n  .row{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .controls{margin-top:10px}\n  input[type=range].scrub{width:100%;accent-color:var(--accent)}\n  .three{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;background:#08101e;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}\n  .metric{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;\n    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n  .metric:last-child{border-bottom:none}\n  .metric .k{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\n  .metric .v{font-size:17px;font-weight:800;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .metric .v small{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;margin-left:3px}\n  .pill{font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700}\n  .pill.good{background:rgba(55,214,154,.16);color:var(--good)}\n  .pill.warn{background:rgba(255,207,92,.16);color:var(--warn)}\n  .pill.bad{background:rgba(255,107,107,.16);color:var(--bad)}\n  .tips li{margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.6;font-size:13.5px}\n  .tips li b{color:var(--accent)}\n  .settings label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;\n    font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0}\n  .settings input[type=number],.settings select{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);\n    color:var(--txt);border-radius:7px;padding:5px 8px;width:96px;font-size:13px}\n  .settings input[type=checkbox]{accent-color:var(--accent);width:16px;height:16px}\n  .progress{height:8px;background:var(--panel2);border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:10px;display:none}\n  .progress.on{display:block}\n  .progress > i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));transition:width .1s}\n  .status{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;min-height:16px}\n  .legend{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}\n  .legend span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n  .sw{width:14px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;display:inline-block}\n  .note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-top:10px;\n    background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:10px}\n  .tabbar{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:10px}\n  .tabbar button{flex:1;background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);\n    padding:7px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\n  .tabbar button.active{background:var(--accent);color:#04121f;border-color:var(--accent)}\n  .hidden{display:none!important}\n  .kv2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n  .mini{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:9px}\n  .mini .k{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}\n  .mini .v{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;margin-top:2px}\n  footer{color:var(--muted);font-size:11.5px;text-align:center;margin-top:26px;line-height:1.7}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <header class=\"top\">\n    <h1>⛳ Golf 3D Swing Lab</h1>\n    <span class=\"badge\">グリップ力ベクトル解析</span>\n    <span class=\"badge\">ブラウザ内AI・動画は端末外に出ません</span>\n  </header>\n  <p class=\"sub\">\n    スイング動画をアップロードするだけで、AIが<b>手とクラブの接点（グリップ）</b>を毎フレーム3D追跡し、\n    その運動から<b>合力の向き（3次元ベクトル）</b>を推定して動画上に重ねます。自分のスイングを立体的に見て、改善点を自習できます。\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <!-- LEFT: stage -->\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h2>スイング動画 & 力ベクトル</h2>\n        <div class=\"stagewrap\" id=\"stage\">\n          <video id=\"vid\" playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></video>\n          <canvas id=\"overlay\"></canvas>\n          <div class=\"drop\" id=\"drop\">\n            <b>▶ 動画をドラッグ＆ドロップ / クリックで選択</b>\n            <small>正面（フェースオン）または飛球線後方（ダウン・ザ・ライン）から、\n            体全体が入る固定カメラの動画が最適です。5〜15秒程度・mp4/mov 推奨。</small>\n            <span class=\"btn sm\">ファイルを選ぶ</span>\n            <input type=\"file\" id=\"file\" accept=\"video/*\" class=\"hidden\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"controls\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <button class=\"btn\" id=\"analyzeBtn\" disabled>🔎 スイングを解析</button>\n            <button class=\"btn ghost sm\" id=\"playBtn\" disabled>▶ 再生</button>\n            <button class=\"btn ghost sm\" id=\"loopBtn\" disabled>🔁 インパクト前後</button>\n            <span class=\"status\" id=\"frameLabel\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"><i id=\"progressBar\"></i></div>\n          <div class=\"status\" id=\"status\">モデルを読み込み中…</div>\n          <input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"0\" value=\"0\" step=\"1\" class=\"scrub\" id=\"scrub\" disabled />\n          <div class=\"legend\">\n            <span><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:var(--force)\"></i>合力ベクトル（加速度ベース推定）</span>\n            <span><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:var(--accent)\"></i>グリップ軌道</span>\n            <span><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:var(--good)\"></i>骨格トラッキング</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n        <h2>3D ビュー（グリップ軌道 + 合力）</h2>\n        <div class=\"three\" id=\"three\"></div>\n        <div class=\"note\">\n          白い曲線＝グリップの3D軌道／赤い矢印＝現在フレームの合力の向き。マウスドラッグで回転できます。\n          奥行き（Z）はAI推定のため参考値です。\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT: panel -->\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"tabbar\">\n          <button data-tab=\"metrics\" class=\"active\">📊 診断</button>\n          <button data-tab=\"tips\">💡 改善アドバイス</button>\n          <button data-tab=\"settings\">⚙️ 設定</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"tab-metrics\">\n          <div class=\"metric\"><span class=\"k\">ピークグリップ速度</span>\n            <span class=\"v\" id=\"mSpeed\">–<small>m/s</small></span></div>\n          <div class=\"metric\"><span class=\"k\">最大合力（推定）</span>\n            <span class=\"v\" id=\"mForce\">–<small>N</small></span></div>\n          <div class=\"metric\"><span class=\"k\">力のピークタイミング <span id=\"mForceTimePill\" class=\"pill\"></span></span>\n            <span class=\"v\" id=\"mForceTime\">–</span></div>\n          <div class=\"metric\"><span class=\"k\">スイングテンポ（切返し:切下し） <span id=\"mTempoPill\" class=\"pill\"></span></span>\n            <span class=\"v\" id=\"mTempo\">–</span></div>\n          <div class=\"metric\"><span class=\"k\">スイングプレーン角 <span id=\"mPlanePill\" class=\"pill\"></span></span>\n            <span class=\"v\" id=\"mPlane\">–<small>°</small></span></div>\n          <div class=\"metric\"><span class=\"k\">インパクト時の力の向き</span>\n            <span class=\"v\" id=\"mDir\">–</span></div>\n          <div class=\"kv2\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n            <div class=\"mini\"><div class=\"k\">推定利き手</div><div class=\"v\" id=\"mHand\">–</div></div>\n            <div class=\"mini\"><div class=\"k\">トラッキング成功率</div><div class=\"v\" id=\"mTrack\">–</div></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"note\" id=\"scoreNote\">動画をアップして「スイングを解析」を押すと診断が表示されます。</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"tab-tips\" class=\"hidden\">\n          <ul class=\"tips\" id=\"tipsList\">\n            <li>解析後、あなたのスイングデータに基づく改善アドバイスがここに表示されます。</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"tab-settings\" class=\"hidden settings\">\n          <label>身長（cm）<span title=\"速度・力の実数換算に使用\">\n            <input type=\"number\" id=\"setHeight\" value=\"170\" min=\"120\" max=\"220\" step=\"1\"></span></label>\n          <label>クラブ+手元の実効質量（kg）\n            <input type=\"number\" id=\"setMass\" value=\"0.6\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"3\" step=\"0.05\"></label>\n          <label>解析フレームレート（fps）\n            <select id=\"setFps\"><option>24</option><option selected>30</option><option>48</option><option>60</option></select></label>\n          <label>矢印スケール\n            <input type=\"number\" id=\"setArrow\" value=\"1.0\" min=\"0.2\" max=\"4\" step=\"0.1\"></label>\n          <label>骨格を表示<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"setSkel\" checked></label>\n          <label>グリップ軌道を表示<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"setTrail\" checked></label>\n          <label>平滑化強度\n            <select id=\"setSmooth\"><option>弱</option><option selected>中</option><option>強</option></select></label>\n          <div class=\"note\">\n            ※ 物理量は単眼動画からの<b>運動学的推定</b>です（F≈m·a）。実測の床反力計・力覚センサーとは異なります。\n            身長・実効質量を実際の値にすると数値の精度が上がります。相対比較・傾向把握に活用してください。\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n        <h2>使い方</h2>\n        <ol style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)\">\n          <li>スイング動画をドロップ</li>\n          <li>「スイングを解析」を押す（AIが手・骨格を追跡）</li>\n          <li>矢印＝各瞬間にグリップへ働く合力の向き・大きさ</li>\n          <li>右の診断＆アドバイスで改善点を確認</li>\n          <li>スライダーでコマ送り、インパクト前後をループ再生</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer>\n    Golf 3D Swing Lab — MediaPipe(手/姿勢3D推定) + Three.js による端末内解析。動画データはサーバーへ送信されません。<br>\n    数値はモノキュラー動画からの推定であり、医療・競技判定用途ではありません。\n  </footer>\n</div>\n\n<script type=\"importmap\">\n{ \"imports\": { \"three\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.160.0/build/three.module.js\",\n  \"three/addons/\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.160.0/examples/jsm/\" } }\n</script>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { FilesetResolver, HandLandmarker, PoseLandmarker }\n  from \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@mediapipe/tasks-vision@0.10.14\";\n\n// ---------- DOM ----------\nconst $ = id => document.getElementById(id);\nconst vid=$('vid'), overlay=$('overlay'), octx=overlay.getContext('2d');\nconst drop=$('drop'), fileInput=$('file'), stage=$('stage');\nconst analyzeBtn=$('analyzeBtn'), playBtn=$('playBtn'), loopBtn=$('loopBtn');\nconst scrub=$('scrub'), status=$('status'), frameLabel=$('frameLabel');\nconst progress=$('progress'), progressBar=$('progressBar');\n\n// ---------- State ----------\nlet handLM=null, poseLM=null, modelsReady=false;\nlet frames=[];        // per-frame kinematic data\nlet analyzed=false, playing=false, loopMode=false, rafId=null;\nlet metrics=null;\nconst S = { impactIdx:0, topIdx:0, startIdx:0 };\n\n// ---------- Settings ----------\nconst settings = ()=>({\n  height:  +$('setHeight').value || 170,\n  mass:    +$('setMass').value || 0.6,\n  fps:     +$('setFps').value || 30,\n  arrow:   +$('setArrow').value || 1,\n  skel:    $('setSkel').checked,\n  trail:   $('setTrail').checked,\n  smooth:  {'弱':1,'中':2,'強':4}[$('setSmooth').value] ?? 2,\n});\n\n// ================= Model load =================\nasync function loadModels(){\n  try{\n    const fileset = await FilesetResolver.forVisionTasks(\n      \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@mediapipe/tasks-vision@0.10.14/wasm\");\n    handLM = await HandLandmarker.createFromOptions(fileset,{\n      baseOptions:{ modelAssetPath:\n        \"https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/hand_landmarker/hand_landmarker/float16/1/hand_landmarker.task\",\n        delegate:\"GPU\"},\n      numHands:2, runningMode:\"VIDEO\" });\n    poseLM = await PoseLandmarker.createFromOptions(fileset,{\n      baseOptions:{ modelAssetPath:\n        \"https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/pose_landmarker/pose_landmarker_lite/float16/1/pose_landmarker_lite.task\",\n        delegate:\"GPU\"},\n      numPoses:1, runningMode:\"VIDEO\" });\n    modelsReady=true;\n    status.textContent=\"準備完了。スイング動画をアップロードしてください。\";\n  }catch(e){\n    console.error(e);\n    status.textContent=\"⚠ AIモデルの読み込みに失敗しました。ネット接続を確認して再読み込みしてください。\";\n  }\n}\nloadModels();\n\n// ================= File handling =================\nfunction openFile(f){\n  if(!f || !f.type.startsWith('video')){ status.textContent=\"⚠ 動画ファイルを選んでください。\"; return; }\n  const url=URL.createObjectURL(f);\n  vid.src=url; analyzed=false; frames=[]; metrics=null; resetUI();\n  vid.onloadedmetadata=()=>{\n    sizeCanvas();\n    drop.style.display='none';\n    analyzeBtn.disabled = !modelsReady;\n    status.textContent = modelsReady\n      ? `読み込み完了：${vid.videoWidth}×${vid.videoHeight}, ${vid.duration.toFixed(1)}秒。「スイングを解析」を押してください。`\n      : \"AIモデルを読み込み中… 完了までお待ちください。\";\n    vid.currentTime=0;\n  };\n}\ndrop.addEventListener('click',()=>fileInput.click());\nfileInput.addEventListener('change',e=>openFile(e.target.files[0]));\n['dragenter','dragover'].forEach(ev=>drop.addEventListener(ev,e=>{e.preventDefault();drop.classList.add('drag');}));\n['dragleave','drop'].forEach(ev=>drop.addEventListener(ev,e=>{e.preventDefault();drop.classList.remove('drag');}));\ndrop.addEventListener('drop',e=>openFile(e.dataTransfer.files[0]));\n\nfunction sizeCanvas(){\n  const r=stage.getBoundingClientRect();\n  overlay.width=r.width; overlay.height=r.height;\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('resize',()=>{ sizeCanvas(); if(analyzed) drawFrame(+scrub.value); });\n\nfunction resetUI(){\n  playBtn.disabled=loopBtn.disabled=scrub.disabled=true;\n  progress.classList.remove('on'); frameLabel.textContent='';\n  octx.clearRect(0,0,overlay.width,overlay.height);\n}\n\n// ================= Analysis =================\nfunction seekTo(t){ return new Promise(res=>{\n  const on=()=>{ vid.removeEventListener('seeked',on); res(); };\n  vid.addEventListener('seeked',on); vid.currentTime=Math.min(t, vid.duration-0.001);\n});}\n\nasync function analyze(){\n  if(!modelsReady){ status.textContent=\"AIモデル準備中です…\"; return; }\n  const s=settings();\n  analyzeBtn.disabled=true; playBtn.disabled=loopBtn.disabled=true;\n  progress.classList.add('on'); progressBar.style.width='0%';\n  vid.pause();\n\n  const dur=vid.duration;\n  let n=Math.min(Math.ceil(dur*s.fps), 640);\n  const dt=dur/n;\n  const raw=[]; let tracked=0; let handVotes=0, count=0;\n\n  for(let i=0;i<n;i++){\n    const t=i*dt;\n    await seekTo(t);\n    const tsMs=Math.round(t*1000)+i; // strictly increasing\n    let grip=null, pose=null, hand=null, handedness=null;\n    try{\n      const hr=handLM.detectForVideo(vid, tsMs);\n      const pr=poseLM.detectForVideo(vid, tsMs);\n      grip=gripFromHands(hr);\n      handedness=handedFromResult(hr);\n      if(pr.landmarks && pr.landmarks[0]) pose=pr.landmarks[0];\n      if(hr.landmarks) hand=hr.landmarks;\n      if(!grip && pose) grip=gripFromPose(pose); // fallback: mid-wrist\n    }catch(e){/* skip frame */}\n    if(grip){ tracked++; if(handedness){ handVotes+=handedness; count++; } }\n    raw.push({ t, grip, pose, hand });\n    if(i%3===0){ progressBar.style.width=(100*i/n).toFixed(0)+'%';\n      status.textContent=`解析中… ${i}/${n} フレーム`; await tick(); }\n  }\n  progressBar.style.width='100%';\n\n  // interpolate missing grips\n  fillGaps(raw);\n  // build kinematics\n  frames = buildKinematics(raw, dt, s);\n  computeEvents();\n  metrics = computeMetrics(dt, s, tracked/n, count? (handVotes/count):0);\n  renderMetrics(); renderTips();\n  build3D();\n\n  analyzed=true; analyzeBtn.disabled=false;\n  playBtn.disabled=loopBtn.disabled=scrub.disabled=false;\n  scrub.max=frames.length-1; scrub.value=S.impactIdx;\n  progress.classList.remove('on');\n  status.textContent=`解析完了：${frames.length}フレーム。スライダーでコマ送り、または再生できます。`;\n  await seekTo(frames[S.impactIdx].t); drawFrame(S.impactIdx);\n}\nanalyzeBtn.addEventListener('click',analyze);\nconst tick=()=>new Promise(r=>requestAnimationFrame(r));\n\n// grip = centroid of both hands near the club (wrist + finger MCPs)\nfunction gripFromHands(hr){\n  if(!hr.landmarks || !hr.landmarks.length) return null;\n  let sx=0,sy=0,sz=0,c=0;\n  for(const lm of hr.landmarks){\n    for(const idx of [0,5,9,13,17]){ sx+=lm[idx].x; sy+=lm[idx].y; sz+=lm[idx].z; c++; }\n  }\n  return {x:sx/c, y:sy/c, z:sz/c};\n}\nfunction gripFromPose(p){ // midpoint of wrists 15,16\n  if(!p[15]||!p[16]) return null;\n  return {x:(p[15].x+p[16].x)/2, y:(p[15].y+p[16].y)/2, z:(p[15].z+p[16].z)/2};\n}\nfunction handedFromResult(hr){\n  if(!hr.handedness || !hr.handedness.length) return null;\n  // vote: which hand is lower on grip → lead hand; simplistic: return +1 right-handed guess\n  return null;\n}\n\nfunction fillGaps(raw){\n  const n=raw.length;\n  for(let i=0;i<n;i++){\n    if(raw[i].grip) continue;\n    let a=i-1; while(a>=0 && !raw[a].grip) a--;\n    let b=i+1; while(b<n && !raw[b].grip) b++;\n    if(a>=0 && b<n){ const f=(i-a)/(b-a); raw[i].grip=lerp3(raw[a].grip,raw[b].grip,f); }\n    else if(a>=0) raw[i].grip={...raw[a].grip};\n    else if(b<n) raw[i].grip={...raw[b].grip};\n    else raw[i].grip={x:.5,y:.5,z:0};\n  }\n}\nconst lerp=(a,b,f)=>a+(b-a)*f;\nconst lerp3=(a,b,f)=>({x:lerp(a.x,b.x,f),y:lerp(a.y,b.y,f),z:lerp(a.z,b.z,f)});\n\n// convert normalized→pixels→meters, then velocity/accel/force\nfunction buildKinematics(raw, dt, s){\n  const W=vid.videoWidth, H=vid.videoHeight;\n  // meters-per-pixel from body height (nose→ankle ≈ 0.87*height)\n  let mpp = estimateMPP(raw, H, s.height);\n  // grip in pixel space\n  const px = raw.map(r=>({ x:r.grip.x*W, y:r.grip.y*H, z:r.grip.z*W, t:r.t,\n                           pose:r.pose, hand:r.hand,\n                           gx:r.grip.x, gy:r.grip.y }));\n  smooth(px, s.smooth);\n  const out=[];\n  for(let i=0;i<px.length;i++){\n    const p=px[i];\n    const pm={x:p.x, y:p.y, z:p.z};\n    // central difference velocity (px/s)\n    const a=px[Math.max(0,i-1)], b=px[Math.min(px.length-1,i+1)];\n    const h=(Math.min(px.length-1,i+1)-Math.max(0,i-1))*dt || dt;\n    const v={x:(b.x-a.x)/h, y:(b.y-a.y)/h, z:(b.z-a.z)/h};\n    out.push({...p, v, mpp});\n  }\n  // acceleration from velocity\n  for(let i=0;i<out.length;i++){\n    const a=out[Math.max(0,i-1)], b=out[Math.min(out.length-1,i+1)];\n    const h=(Math.min(out.length-1,i+1)-Math.max(0,i-1))*dt || dt;\n    const acc={x:(b.v.x-a.v.x)/h, y:(b.v.y-a.v.y)/h, z:(b.v.z-a.v.z)/h};\n    out[i].acc=acc;\n    // meters\n    out[i].speed = Math.hypot(out[i].v.x,out[i].v.y,out[i].v.z)*out[i].mpp;\n    const accMag = Math.hypot(acc.x,acc.y,acc.z)*out[i].mpp;\n    out[i].accMag = accMag;\n    out[i].force = s.mass*accMag; // N (approx)\n    // force direction unit (screen coords: x right, y down, z depth)\n    const m=Math.hypot(acc.x,acc.y,acc.z)||1;\n    out[i].fdir={x:acc.x/m, y:acc.y/m, z:acc.z/m};\n  }\n  return out;\n}\n\nfunction estimateMPP(raw,H,heightCm){\n  const heights=[];\n  for(const r of raw){\n    const p=r.pose; if(!p) continue;\n    const nose=p[0]; const la=p[27], ra=p[28];\n    if(!nose||!la||!ra) continue;\n    const ankleY=(la.y+ra.y)/2;\n    const dyPx=Math.abs(ankleY-nose.y)*H;\n    if(dyPx>30) heights.push(dyPx);\n  }\n  if(!heights.length) return (heightCm/100)/(0.87* (H*0.6)); // fallback guess\n  heights.sort((a,b)=>a-b);\n  const med=heights[Math.floor(heights.length/2)];\n  const bodyMeters=(heightCm/100)*0.87; // nose→ankle fraction\n  return bodyMeters/med; // meters per pixel\n}\n\nfunction smooth(arr, passes){\n  for(let p=0;p<passes;p++){\n    const cp=arr.map(a=>({x:a.x,y:a.y,z:a.z}));\n    for(let i=1;i<arr.length-1;i++){\n      arr[i].x=(cp[i-1].x+2*cp[i].x+cp[i+1].x)/4;\n      arr[i].y=(cp[i-1].y+2*cp[i].y+cp[i+1].y)/4;\n      arr[i].z=(cp[i-1].z+2*cp[i].z+cp[i+1].z)/4;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n// ============ Swing events (top / impact / start) ============\nfunction computeEvents(){\n  let impactIdx=0, mx=-1;\n  for(let i=0;i<frames.length;i++){ if(frames[i].speed>mx){mx=frames[i].speed;impactIdx=i;} }\n  // top of backswing: local speed minimum before impact (grip nearly stops)\n  let topIdx=0, mn=Infinity;\n  for(let i=Math.floor(impactIdx*0.15);i<impactIdx;i++){\n    if(frames[i].speed<mn){mn=frames[i].speed;topIdx=i;}\n  }\n  // start of takeaway: first frame where speed rises above 10% peak before top\n  let startIdx=0;\n  const th=mx*0.10;\n  for(let i=0;i<topIdx;i++){ if(frames[i].speed>th){startIdx=Math.max(0,i-1);break;} }\n  S.impactIdx=impactIdx; S.topIdx=topIdx; S.startIdx=startIdx;\n}\n\nfunction computeMetrics(dt,s,trackRate,handVote){\n  const peak=frames[S.impactIdx];\n  let maxF=0, maxFIdx=0;\n  for(let i=0;i<frames.length;i++){ if(frames[i].force>maxF){maxF=frames[i].force;maxFIdx=i;} }\n  const backTime=(S.topIdx-S.startIdx)*dt;\n  const downTime=(S.impactIdx-S.topIdx)*dt || dt;\n  const tempo=backTime/downTime;\n  // swing plane angle from top→impact grip line (screen px, y down)\n  const a=frames[S.topIdx], b=frames[S.impactIdx];\n  let plane=Math.abs(Math.atan2(-(b.y-a.y), (b.x-a.x))*180/Math.PI);\n  if(plane>90) plane=180-plane;\n  // impact force direction label\n  const f=frames[S.impactIdx].fdir;\n  // force peak relative to impact (ms before)\n  const fPeakOffset=(S.impactIdx-maxFIdx)*dt*1000; // + means before impact\n  // handedness: grip moving left→right (screen) during downswing? right-handed golfer face-on → grip goes to left. rough\n  const dx=b.x-a.x;\n  const hand = dx<0 ? '右打ち（推定）':'左打ち（推定）';\n  return {\n    peakSpeed:peak.speed, maxForce:maxF, forcePeakOffset:fPeakOffset,\n    tempo, backTime, downTime, plane, impactDir:f, hand, trackRate,\n  };\n}\n\n// ================= Rendering overlay =================\nfunction drawFrame(i){\n  i=Math.max(0,Math.min(frames.length-1,i|0));\n  const s=settings();\n  octx.clearRect(0,0,overlay.width,overlay.height);\n  // draw current video frame\n  octx.drawImage(vid,0,0,overlay.width,overlay.height);\n  if(!analyzed){ return; }\n  const sx=overlay.width/vid.videoWidth, sy=overlay.height/vid.videoHeight;\n  const fr=frames[i];\n\n  if(s.skel && fr.pose) drawPose(fr.pose,sx,sy);\n  if(s.trail) drawTrail(i,sx,sy);\n  drawForce(fr,sx,sy,s);\n\n  // labels\n  frameLabel.textContent=`フレーム ${i+1}/${frames.length}　合力 ${fr.force.toFixed(0)} N　速度 ${fr.speed.toFixed(1)} m/s`\n    + (i===S.impactIdx?'　⟵ インパクト':'')\n    + (i===S.topIdx?'　⟵ トップ':'');\n  update3D(i);\n  scrub.value=i;\n}\n\nconst POSE_CONN=[[11,12],[11,13],[13,15],[12,14],[14,16],[11,23],[12,24],[23,24],\n  [23,25],[25,27],[24,26],[26,28],[27,31],[28,32]];\nfunction drawPose(p,sx,sy){\n  octx.lineWidth=3; octx.strokeStyle='rgba(55,214,154,.8)';\n  octx.beginPath();\n  for(const [a,b] of POSE_CONN){ if(!p[a]||!p[b])continue;\n    octx.moveTo(p[a].x*vid.videoWidth*sx, p[a].y*vid.videoHeight*sy);\n    octx.lineTo(p[b].x*vid.videoWidth*sx, p[b].y*vid.videoHeight*sy);}\n  octx.stroke();\n  octx.fillStyle='rgba(55,214,154,.9)';\n  for(const idx of [11,12,13,14,15,16,23,24,25,26,27,28]){ if(!p[idx])continue;\n    octx.beginPath();octx.arc(p[idx].x*vid.videoWidth*sx,p[idx].y*vid.videoHeight*sy,3.5,0,7);octx.fill();}\n}\n\nfunction drawTrail(cur,sx,sy){\n  octx.lineWidth=2.5;\n  octx.beginPath();\n  for(let i=S.startIdx;i<=Math.min(cur,S.impactIdx+6);i++){\n    const x=frames[i].x*sx, y=frames[i].y*sy;\n    if(i===S.startIdx)octx.moveTo(x,y); else octx.lineTo(x,y);\n  }\n  octx.strokeStyle='rgba(63,182,255,.85)'; octx.stroke();\n}\n\nfunction drawForce(fr,sx,sy,s){\n  const ox=fr.x*sx, oy=fr.y*sy;\n  // arrow length scales with force; base on max\n  const norm=metrics? Math.min(1.4, fr.force/(metrics.maxForce||1)) : 0.6;\n  const len=(80+120*norm)*s.arrow;\n  // in-plane direction from acceleration (x right, y down). z→arrowhead size + hue\n  let dx=fr.fdir.x, dy=fr.fdir.y;\n  const inPlane=Math.hypot(dx,dy)||1; dx/=inPlane; dy/=inPlane;\n  const ex=ox+dx*len, ey=oy+dy*len;\n  const depth=fr.fdir.z; // negative=toward camera\n  // glow\n  octx.save();\n  octx.shadowColor='rgba(255,77,94,.9)'; octx.shadowBlur=14;\n  octx.strokeStyle=depth<0?'#ff8a5e':'#ff4d5e';\n  octx.fillStyle=octx.strokeStyle;\n  octx.lineWidth=6+6*norm;\n  octx.beginPath(); octx.moveTo(ox,oy); octx.lineTo(ex,ey); octx.stroke();\n  // arrowhead\n  const ang=Math.atan2(ey-oy,ex-ox);\n  const hs=16+14*norm+ (depth<0? 8:0);\n  octx.beginPath();\n  octx.moveTo(ex,ey);\n  octx.lineTo(ex-hs*Math.cos(ang-0.4), ey-hs*Math.sin(ang-0.4));\n  octx.lineTo(ex-hs*Math.cos(ang+0.4), ey-hs*Math.sin(ang+0.4));\n  octx.closePath(); octx.fill();\n  octx.restore();\n  // grip marker\n  octx.fillStyle='#fff'; octx.beginPath(); octx.arc(ox,oy,6,0,7); octx.fill();\n  octx.strokeStyle='#ff4d5e'; octx.lineWidth=3; octx.beginPath(); octx.arc(ox,oy,9,0,7); octx.stroke();\n  // depth hint text\n  octx.fillStyle='rgba(255,255,255,.85)'; octx.font='12px system-ui';\n  octx.fillText(depth<-0.03?'⊙ 手前向き':depth>0.03?'⊗ 奥向き':'', ox+12, oy-12);\n}\n\n// ================= Playback =================\nfunction play(){\n  if(playing){ stopPlay(); return; }\n  playing=true; playBtn.textContent='⏸ 停止';\n  let i=loopMode? Math.max(0,S.topIdx-4): 0;\n  const endI=loopMode? Math.min(frames.length-1,S.impactIdx+10): frames.length-1;\n  const step=async()=>{\n    if(!playing) return;\n    await seekTo(frames[i].t); drawFrame(i);\n    i++;\n    if(i>endI){ if(loopMode){ i=Math.max(0,S.topIdx-4); } else { stopPlay(); return; } }\n    rafId=setTimeout(step, 1000/12); // slow-mo review\n  };\n  step();\n}\nfunction stopPlay(){ playing=false; playBtn.textContent='▶ 再生'; clearTimeout(rafId); }\nplayBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{ loopMode=false; play(); });\nloopBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{ loopMode=true; if(playing)stopPlay(); play(); });\nscrub.addEventListener('input',async e=>{ stopPlay(); const i=+e.target.value;\n  await seekTo(frames[i].t); drawFrame(i); });\n\n// ================= Metrics UI =================\nfunction pill(el,cls,txt){ el.className='pill '+cls; el.textContent=txt; }\nfunction renderMetrics(){\n  const m=metrics;\n  $('mSpeed').innerHTML=`${m.peakSpeed.toFixed(1)}<small>m/s</small>`;\n  $('mForce').innerHTML=`${m.maxForce.toFixed(0)}<small>N</small>`;\n  const off=m.forcePeakOffset;\n  $('mForceTime').textContent = off>=0? `インパクト ${off.toFixed(0)}ms 前` : `インパクト ${(-off).toFixed(0)}ms 後`;\n  pill($('mForceTimePill'), (off>=-20&&off<=120)?'good':'warn', (off>=-20&&off<=120)?'理想的':'要調整');\n  $('mTempo').textContent=`${m.tempo.toFixed(1)} : 1`;\n  const tGood=Math.abs(m.tempo-3)<=0.8;\n  pill($('mTempoPill'), tGood?'good':(Math.abs(m.tempo-3)<=1.5?'warn':'bad'), tGood?'◎ 3:1に近い':'要改善');\n  $('mPlane').innerHTML=`${m.plane.toFixed(0)}<small>°</small>`;\n  const pGood=m.plane>=45&&m.plane<=60;\n  pill($('mPlanePill'), pGood?'good':'warn', pGood?'標準':(m.plane<45?'フラット':'スティープ'));\n  const f=m.impactDir;\n  $('mDir').textContent=dirLabel(f);\n  $('mHand').textContent=m.hand;\n  $('mTrack').textContent=(m.trackRate*100).toFixed(0)+'%';\n  let sn=`ピーク速度 ${m.peakSpeed.toFixed(1)} m/s、最大合力 ${m.maxForce.toFixed(0)} N。`;\n  if(m.trackRate<0.6) sn+=' ※ トラッキング成功率が低め。明るく・体全体が写る固定カメラ動画だと精度が上がります。';\n  $('scoreNote').textContent=sn;\n}\nfunction dirLabel(f){\n  const parts=[];\n  parts.push(f.y<-0.15?'上方':f.y>0.15?'下方':'水平');\n  parts.push(f.x>0.15?'右':f.x<-0.15?'左':'');\n  parts.push(f.z<-0.15?'/手前':f.z>0.15?'/奥':'');\n  return parts.filter(Boolean).join('');\n}\n\n// ================= Tips =================\nfunction renderTips(){\n  const m=metrics, tips=[];\n  // tempo\n  if(Math.abs(m.tempo-3)>0.8){\n    if(m.tempo<3) tips.push(`<b>切り返しが急いでいます</b>（テンポ ${m.tempo.toFixed(1)}:1）。理想は約3:1。トップで一瞬“間”を作り、バックスイングをゆったり取ると、切り下しで力を溜められます。`);\n    else tips.push(`<b>ダウンスイングが緩んでいます</b>（テンポ ${m.tempo.toFixed(1)}:1）。トップから一気に加速する意識で、下半身リードの切り返しを試しましょう。`);\n  } else tips.push(`<b>テンポは理想的（${m.tempo.toFixed(1)}:1）</b>。この“間”を維持しつつ再現性を高めましょう。`);\n  // plane\n  if(m.plane>60) tips.push(`<b>スイングプレーンがスティープ（${m.plane.toFixed(0)}°）</b>。クラブが立ちやすくアウトサイドイン／ダフリの傾向。トップで手を少し低く、右肘を体側に引く意識でシャローに。`);\n  else if(m.plane<45) tips.push(`<b>プレーンがフラット（${m.plane.toFixed(0)}°）</b>。インサイドに引き込みすぎるとフックや詰まりの原因に。少し縦の始動を意識しましょう。`);\n  else tips.push(`<b>プレーン角は標準域（${m.plane.toFixed(0)}°）</b>。良い軌道です。`);\n  // force timing\n  if(m.forcePeakOffset<-20) tips.push(`<b>力のピークがインパcompact後（${(-m.forcePeakOffset).toFixed(0)}ms後）</b>。当たってから力むと減速します。インパクト手前で最大加速するよう、リリースを少し早めに。`);\n  else if(m.forcePeakOffset>150) tips.push(`<b>力のピークが早すぎ（インパクト${m.forcePeakOffset.toFixed(0)}ms前）</b>。手元が早く減速し“キャスティング”気味。ため（ラグ）を保ち、インパクト直前まで力を残しましょう。`);\n  else tips.push(`<b>力のピーク位置は良好</b>。インパクト直前に合力が最大＝効率的にエネルギーが伝わっています。`);\n  // impact direction\n  const f=m.impactDir;\n  if(f.y>0.3) tips.push(`インパクトで合力が<b>下向き</b>成分大。突っ込み／体の沈み込みに注意。軸を保って回転主体のスイングを。`);\n  if(Math.abs(f.z)>0.3) tips.push(`奥行き方向の力が大きめ＝<b>前後の重心移動</b>が強め。インパクトで頭の位置を残すと安定します。`);\n  // speed encouragement\n  tips.push(`ピークグリップ速度は <b>${m.peakSpeed.toFixed(1)} m/s</b>。設定でクラブ質量・身長を実値にすると数値がより正確になります。スライダーでトップ〜インパクトをコマ送りし、矢印の向きの変化を確認しましょう。`);\n  $('tipsList').innerHTML=tips.map(t=>`<li>${t}</li>`).join('');\n}\n\n// ================= 3D view =================\nlet three={};\nfunction init3D(){\n  const el=$('three'); const w=el.clientWidth, h=el.clientHeight;\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene(); scene.background=new THREE.Color(0x08101e);\n  const cam=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(50,w/h,0.1,100); cam.position.set(2.4,1.4,2.8);\n  const rnd=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true}); rnd.setSize(w,h); rnd.setPixelRatio(devicePixelRatio);\n  el.innerHTML=''; el.appendChild(rnd.domElement);\n  const ctrl=new OrbitControls(cam,rnd.domElement); ctrl.enableDamping=true; ctrl.target.set(0,0.2,0);\n  scene.add(new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff,0.7));\n  const dl=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,0.8); dl.position.set(3,5,2); scene.add(dl);\n  const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(4,16,0x2a3a5c,0x1a2740); scene.add(grid);\n  const axes=new THREE.AxesHelper(0.8); scene.add(axes);\n  three={scene,cam,rnd,ctrl,el,trail:null,arrow:null,gripDot:null};\n  (function loop(){ requestAnimationFrame(loop); ctrl.update(); rnd.render(scene,cam); })();\n}\nfunction build3D(){\n  if(!three.scene) init3D();\n  const sc=three.scene;\n  if(three.trail){ sc.remove(three.trail); }\n  // build normalized trajectory in 3D (screen x, -y up, z depth) centered/scaled\n  const pts=[]; const xs=[],ys=[],zs=[];\n  for(let i=S.startIdx;i<=Math.min(S.impactIdx+8,frames.length-1);i++){\n    xs.push(frames[i].gx); ys.push(frames[i].y/vid.videoHeight); zs.push(frames[i].z/vid.videoWidth);\n  }\n  const cx=avg(xs),cy=avg(ys),cz=avg(zs);\n  const idxMap=[];\n  for(let i=S.startIdx;i<=Math.min(S.impactIdx+8,frames.length-1);i++){\n    const p=new THREE.Vector3((frames[i].gx-cx)*3, -(frames[i].y/vid.videoHeight-cy)*3, (frames[i].z/vid.videoWidth-cz)*3);\n    pts.push(p); idxMap.push(i);\n  }\n  const g=new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(pts);\n  three.trail=new THREE.Line(g,new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:0xffffff}));\n  sc.add(three.trail);\n  three.center={cx,cy,cz}; three.idxMap=idxMap;\n  if(!three.gripDot){\n    three.gripDot=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.05,16,16),\n      new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x3fb6ff,emissive:0x1b6fb0}));\n    sc.add(three.gripDot);\n  }\n  update3D(S.impactIdx);\n}\nfunction update3D(i){\n  if(!three.scene||!three.center) return;\n  const {cx,cy,cz}=three.center;\n  const fr=frames[i];\n  const pos=new THREE.Vector3((fr.gx-cx)*3, -(fr.y/vid.videoHeight-cy)*3, (fr.z/vid.videoWidth-cz)*3);\n  three.gripDot.position.copy(pos);\n  if(three.arrow){ three.scene.remove(three.arrow); }\n  const dir=new THREE.Vector3(fr.fdir.x, -fr.fdir.y, fr.fdir.z).normalize();\n  const norm=metrics? Math.min(1.5, fr.force/(metrics.maxForce||1)):0.6;\n  three.arrow=new THREE.ArrowHelper(dir,pos,0.5+0.9*norm,0xff4d5e,0.2+0.15*norm,0.14+0.1*norm);\n  three.scene.add(three.arrow);\n}\nconst avg=a=>a.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/(a.length||1);\n\n// ================= Tabs =================\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.tabbar button').forEach(b=>{\n  b.addEventListener('click',()=>{\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tabbar button').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));\n    b.classList.add('active');\n    for(const t of ['metrics','tips','settings'])\n      $('tab-'+t).classList.toggle('hidden', t!==b.dataset.tab);\n    if(b.dataset.tab==='settings') setTimeout(()=>{ if(three.rnd){} },0);\n  });\n});\n// re-render when settings change\n['setArrow','setSkel','setTrail','setMass','setHeight','setSmooth'].forEach(id=>{\n  $(id).addEventListener('change',()=>{ if(analyzed) drawFrame(+scrub.value); });\n});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"ts":"2026-07-19T13:26:14.576Z"}
